      "sourceHash": "4a44589f689bdfde",
      "translationZh": "额外的 CPU 和 GPU 支持的模型可作为早期发布提供: Qwen-image, Z-Image-Turbo, Granite 4.0 H Tiny, Fun-ASR-Nano, LFM2.5-8B-A1B, MiniCPM5-2B, RF-DETR, BGE Reranker-V2-M3, BGE M3",
