    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f7ae07137538dfc3",
      "translationZh": "更广泛的 LLM 模型支持和更多模型压缩技术",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5f18113a2882138d",
      "translationZh": "OpenVINO™ GenAI 添加了 Multi-Token Prediction (MTP) speculative decoding，适用于 Gemma 4、Qwen 3.5 和 Qwen 3.6，在 CPU 和 GPU 上实现更高吞吐量和更低延迟，而不牺牲准确性。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f790f278a26848a3",
      "translationZh": "在 OpenVINO™ GenAI 中，现在支持用于 EAGLE3 的 Tree Drafting (Top-K)，开发者可以在 VLM 管道上实现比 Chain Drafting (Top-1) 更高的吞吐量。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "beda9bd0fc9def1d",
      "translationZh": "Xe3 集成图形优化在 OpenVINO™ GenAI 中提升了 Gemma 4 模型在 Intel® Core™ Ultra 系列 3 处理器上处理长上下文输入时的 AI 推理性能。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "621b8bbddc6267f9",
      "translationZh": "OpenVINO™ 将 Instrumentation and Tracing Technology (ITT) 性能分析支持扩展到 NPU，使开发者能够使用 Intel® VTune™ Profiler 通过一致的工具链分析 CPU、GPU 和 NPU 的执行。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "930b281046909b79",
      "translationZh": "预览：OpenVINO™ GenAI 为 GPU 上的 Qwen 模型引入 DFlash 加速，并提供 visual-token 支持以降低延迟并加速在 Intel® Core™ Ultra 系列 3 处理器上的 GenAI 管道。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "15f12637665c6471",
      "translationZh": "提供更高的可移植性和性能，以在边缘、云端或本地运行 AI。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "238d5bdebf9b44f1",
      "translationZh": "OpenVINO™ GenAI 为 Node.js 引入 ASRPipeline 支持，使 JavaScript 开发者能够使用类似 C++ 和 Python 的管道 API 运行自动语音识别（如 Whisper 和 Qwen3‑ASR），并提供流式处理和性能指标。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3499b73e49c3c6aa",
      "translationZh": "预览：NPU 上的有界动态形状支持现已扩展到诸如图像超分辨率之类的视觉工作负载。此功能已使用 ESPCN 模型进行验证。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "98f7d18aa1c82f42",
      "translationZh": "预览：OpenVINO™ Model Server 现在包含空闲模型管理的预览支持，可在模型未使用时卸载模型以降低内存使用量。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d79c8253a6e5a291",
      "translationZh": "OpenVINO™ Model Server 新增对 Muse Glimmer 30B 和 Qwen3.8 27B 等新型代理模型的支持。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
